 the base high of $53.48. Volume that day was 1.4M shares, 0.79x the prior 10-day average of 1.7M. It didn't hold. By May 7, 2021 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $64.47.","lesson":"This is an example of a shakeout. The breakout failed by the rules, closing below the level three days running, and then the stock recovered and ran. Cutting it was still the right call when it happened. A failed breakout that fixes itself is worth watching for a re-entry, not a reason to ignore the exit."}}